            <ArticleTitle>[Systemic and regional analgesia in patients undergoing major thoracic surgery].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>576-82; quiz 584</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1055/s-0032-1325290</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Effective, aggressive treatment of pain accompanied with thoracic surgery is important and beneficial for patients, since severe postoperative pulmonary complications and long-term pain will be reduced. In this systematic issue evidence-based strategies in preventing and treating pain after thoracic surgery will be reviewed.</AbstractText>
